===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[millennium]] [[bug]]|-}}

# {{computing}} A [[flaw]] in the [[design]] of very many [[computer]] [[system]]s in which the [[year]] was [[represented]] by just 2 [[digit]]s (e.g. 1984 = 84); after 1999 this would give [[unpredictable]] [[result]]s.

